          "part": "C2765186",
          "tier": "extended",
          "notes": "The suggested USB-C receptacle. Ordinary Extended part. Sixteen contacts, not a six-pin power-only receptacle, but USB 2.0 only \u2014 the SuperSpeed positions are absent. SHOU HAN's drawing rates it at 3 A at 5 V and 10,000 mating cycles; the LCSC listing's 5 A is not supported by the manufacturer. The sixteen contacts come out on twelve pads, and the shell legs need drilled holes despite the SMD package label, so check the footprint against the drawing."
